# Local-only audit chain — retired log captures + dormant scripts.
# Tarballs + SHA-256 manifests live offline at
# archive/. Public repo stays focused on the active
# reproducibility surface; an internal artifact directory clutters
# top-level layout for zero reviewer benefit (INC-39, 2026-04-25).
_archives/

# pytest-cov / coverage.py binary state — generated by pytest --cov;
# never check in.
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# paper2 built PDF — regenerated on every audit pass; was causing pack
# churn (paper1 history alone is 72 versions / 225 MB cumulative). paper1
# PDF stays tracked (published Zenodo artifact). Active TeX builds via
# pdflatex into paper2/latex/ on demand.
paper2/latex/*.pdf

